> sure I don't poly artifacts out of existance?

I don't think artifacts are polyed.

> 7. What happens if you #force a chest open with a cockatrice corpse?
> This should turn the chest/box into a boulder IMO.

It should turn you to stone for being dumb; it probably says you
aren't using a proper weapon for forcing.  Cockatrices don't turn
everything to stone, just living creatures that aren't stoning
resistant.

> 10. Is there some efficient way of discovering that a monster has an
> amulet of lifesaving before killing it and watching it crumble?

A wand of probing (or a lucky Athame hit).  You could either morph
into a nymph to steal the amulet, or stone the creature and loot the
statue.

